lo</span>(name):                                 \n     <span class=\"r5\">return</span> <span class=\"r12\">f&quot;Hello {</span>name<span class=\"r12\">}&quot;</span>                       \n                                                  \n\n                                                  \n plain fenced code                                \n                                                  \n\n<span class=\"r8\">              </span>\n<span class=\"r8\"> </span><span class=\"r8\">Name</span><span class=\"r3\">  </span><span class=\"r8\"> </span><span class=\"r8\">Value</span><span class=\"r8\"> </span>\n<span class=\"r8\"> ──────────── </span>\n<span class=\"r8\"> </span>alpha <span class=\"r8\"> </span>    1<span class=\"r8\"> </span>\n<span class=\"r8\"> </span>beta  <span class=\"r8\"> </span>   22<span class=\"r8\"> </span>\n<span class=\"r8\">              </span>\n\nAn indented code block:                           \n\n    x = [1, 2, 3]                                 \n    print(sum(x))                                 \n\n<span class=\"r13\">--------------------------------------------------</span>\n\nThe end.                                          \n</code></pre>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
